A bit futher renaming of our projects. We seem to have hit the main 
problem of the LKML attitude discussion. It seems indeed the classic 
problem of vanity gods.

A Richard/Linus/Andrew Trinity, results in a 1000 hz timer, and 10ms 
filter in sched.c. And facistic attitudes with swearing and wanting to 
kill over printers, indeed a little communism there. Who thought 
communism was still alive, in the form of a "nerd" sect online.

All you hated about GNU is communism.

Best,
Ywe AKA.
